    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Be aware of undefined behavior in WGSL",
      "source_hash": 14961627834575721663,
      "context_hash": 17893676082090584426,
      "translation": "WGSL의 정의되지 않은 동작에 유의하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:06:26.489268Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Several functions in WGSL are undefined for certain values.",
      "source_hash": 14175952566552038919,
      "context_hash": 14931203006721702366,
      "translation": "WGSL의 여러 함수는 특정 값에 대해 정의되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:06:26.489268Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Trying to raise a negative number to a power with",
      "source_hash": 11875952578908609115,
      "context_hash": 14100167360715272745,
      "translation": "음수를",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:06:26.489268Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "is one example since the result would be an imaginary number.",
      "source_hash": 6373781806784450609,
      "context_hash": 243273368546437335,
      "translation": "로 거듭제곱하려고 하면 그 결과가 허수가 되므로 그 예 중 하나입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:06:26.489268Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "We went over another example above with",
      "source_hash": 1503587285704853716,
      "context_hash": 10014527790882545142,
      "translation": "위에서",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:06:26.489268Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": ".",
      "source_hash": 12781307830597812232,
      "context_hash": 7320428830440635568,
      "translation": "로 또 다른 예를 살펴보았습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:06:26.489268Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "You need to try to be aware of these or else your shaders will get different results on different machines.",
      "source_hash": 3905353473317706984,
      "context_hash": 13226486964919565154,
      "translation": "이러한 점들을 인지하지 않으면 셰이더가 기기에 따라 다른 결과를 낼 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:06:26.489268Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Here's a list of undefined some behaviors.",
