      "translation": "x <= 0이면 결과는 정의되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:06:24.737261Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:32/seg:0",
      "source": "Returns min(max(x, minVal), maxVal).",
      "source_hash": 5619715453051135005,
      "context_hash": 13443786652228275325,
      "translation": "min(max(x, minVal), maxVal)을 반환합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:06:24.737261Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:32/seg:1",
      "source": "Results are undefined if minVal > maxVal",
      "source_hash": 4968836770735064966,
      "context_hash": 1901625222240841044,
      "translation": "minVal > maxVal이면 결과는 정의되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:06:24.737262Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:33/seg:0",
      "source": "Returns 0.0 if x <= edge0 and 1.0 if x >= edge1 and performs smooth Hermite interpolation between 0 and 1 when edge0 < x < edge1.",
      "source_hash": 13989038123209759226,
      "context_hash": 1666808398716614612,
      "translation": "x <= edge0이면 0.0을, x >= edge1이면 1.0을 반환하며, edge0 < x < edge1일 때는 0과 1 사이에서 매끄러운 에르미트 보간을 수행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:06:24.737262Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:33/seg:1",
      "source": "Results are undefined if edge0 >= edge1.",
      "source_hash": 1380674403287277442,
      "context_hash": 4582572089822805059,
      "translation": "edge0 >= edge1이면 결과는 정의되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:06:24.737262Z",
      "issues": []
